02T09:51:17.980-06:00","title":"Virtual Art Museum built with Three js","url":"https://dostoynikov.bearblog.dev/virtual-museum-for-my-wifes-artworks/","score":4,"flags":0,"comment_count":2,"description":"\u003cp\u003eMy wife wanted a website for her artworks. While building the website, I suddenly had this urge to try building a virtual art museum to give her motivation. It turned out not bad. Put the rain mode on if you like cats btw.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI'm still trying to optimize the performance as I'm having random fps-drops on Android devices.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLet me know if you notice any bugs as this project is still in early build. It works best on PCs although tablets and smart phones are also good to go. I'm open to ideas to make it more beautiful.\u003c/p\u003e\n","description_plain":"My wife wanted a website for her artworks. While building the website, I suddenly had this urge to try building a virtual art museum to give her motivation. It turned out not bad. Put the rain mode on if you like cats btw. \r\n\r\nI'm still trying to optimize the performance as I'm having random fps-drops on Android devices. \r\n\r\nLet me know if you notice any bugs as this project is still in early build. It works best on PCs although tablets and smart phones are also good to go. I'm open to ideas to make it more beautiful.","submitter_user":"dostoynikov","user_is_author":true,"tags":["art","culture","javascript"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/c8ayyw","comments_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/c8ayyw/virtual_art_museum_built_with_three_js"},{"short_id":"cqzwwg","created_at":"2026-11-01T12:47:10.632-06:00","title":"London Meetup - Nov 2026","url":"","score":46,"flags":0,"comment_count":8,"description":"\u003cp\u003ePub Address: The Fellow, 24 York Way, London, N1 9AA.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDate: Sunday, 15/11/2026 1pm\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe idea is to just meet and have a chat really.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI have submitted a request to book a table. Hopefully they approve but if not we can just find an un-booked table.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI am posting the meetup prior to receiving their approval, so that those of you who live outside London can (hopefully) bag a cheaper train ticket by booking 2 weeks in advance.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI've created a London Lobsters \u003ca href=\"https://chat.whatsapp.com/LWdobBbWVt315rNzs4a1EZ\" rel=\"ugc\"\u003eWhatsapp group\u003c/a\u003e\ntoo, where we can communicate on the day to share the table number/updates.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease do join it.\u003c/p\u003e\n","description_plain":"Pub Address: The Fellow, 24 York Way, London, N1 9AA.\r\n\r\nDate: Sunday, 15/11/2026 1pm\r\n\r\nThe idea is to just meet and have a chat really. \r\n\r\nI have submitted a request to book a table. Hopefully they approve but if not we can just find an un-booked table. \r\n\r\nI am posting the meetup prior to receiving their approval, so that those of you who live outside London can (hopefully) bag a cheaper train ticket by booking 2 weeks in advance. \r\n\r\nI've created a London Lobsters [Whatsapp group](https://chat.whatsapp.com/LWdobBbWVt315rNzs4a1EZ)\r\n too, where we can communicate on the day to share the table number/updates.\r\n\r\nPlease do join it.","submitter_user":"prole","user_is_author":true,"tags":["event"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/cqzwwg","comments_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/cqzwwg/london_meetup_nov_2026"},{"short_id":"ifznly","created_at":"2026-11-02T10:28:17.226-06:00","title":"New Release: Tor Browser 16.0","url":"https://blog.torproject.org/new-release-tor-browser-160/","score":5,"flags":1,"comment_count":0,"description":"","description_plain":"","submitter_user":"demiguru","user_is_author":false,"tags":["browsers","privacy"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/ifznly","comments_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/ifznly/new_release_tor_browser_16_0"},{"short_id":"wgoato","created_at":"2026-11-02T15:23:24.764-06:00","title":"A Decad